      "a": "The colour of the middle one-third of the flag is white.\n(ii) Where will you draw the Ashoka chakra?\nAns:\nFor Ashoka Chakra I will draw it in the middle of the white portion of the flag.\n(iii) How much of the flag will you colour green?\nAns:\n$(\u2153)^{rd}$ portion of the flag will be coloured green.\n(iv) Is the white colour now less than of the flag? Why?\nAns:\nYes, the white colour is less than the \u2153 of the flag because the Ashoka Chakra is present in the white portion."
