      "q": "2.\nClass 5 Does it Look the Same? Important Questions\nConclusion\nIn conclusion, NCERT Solutions for Class 5 Maths Chapter 5 - \"Does It Look The Same?\" offer young learners a valuable resource for developing their understanding of symmetry and shapes. This chapter introduces fundamental concepts related to symmetry, encouraging students to explore and identify symmetrical objects in their surroundings. The NCERT solutions provide clear explanations and practical exercises that help students comprehend these abstract ideas effectively. The ability to recognize symmetry is not only a mathematical skill but also a crucial aspect of visual and artistic literacy. These solutions play a pivotal role in fostering a solid foundation in mathematics while encouraging students to appreciate symmetry in the world around them.\nNCERT Solutions for Maths Class 8 Chapter-wise Links\nS. No\nNCERT Solutions Class 5 Maths Chapter-wise List\n1\nChapter 1 - The Fish Tale Solutions\n2\nChapter 2 - Shapes and Angles Solutions\n3\nChapter 3 - How Many Squares Solutions\n4\nChapter 4 - Parts and Wholes Solutions\n5\nChapter 6 - Be My Multiple, I\u2019ll be Your Factor Solutions\n6\nChapter 7 - Can you See the Pattern Solutions\n7\nChapter 8 - Mapping Your Way Revision Solutions\n8\nChapter 9 - Boxes and Sketches Solutions\n9\nChapter 10 - Tenths and Hundredths Solutions\n10\nChapter 11 - Area and its Boundary Solutions\n11\nChapter 12 - Smart Charts Solutions\n12\nChapter 13 - Ways to Divide and Multiply Solutions\n13\nChapter 14 - How Big How Heavy Solutions\nImportant Related Links for CBSE Class 5 Maths\nS. No\nOther Study Materials for Class 5 Maths\n1\nNCERT Books for CBSE Class 5 Maths\n2\nClass 5 Syllabus for Maths\n3\nRevision Notes for CBSE Class 5 Maths\n4\nImportant Questions for CBSE Class 5 Maths\n5\nCBSE Sample Paper Class 5 Maths",
